OL,3,AChemistry Nobel awarded for solving
OL,4,Amystery of life's asymmetry
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut living organisms on Earth only
OL,7,Ffunction with one of those forms. The
OL,8,FNobel laureates answered the question:
OL,9,FWhy does life favour just one of these
OL,10,Fmirror image molecules over the other.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
